<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | B Tecky" description="How B Tecky handles information, the Arcade tools, advertising, cookies and embedded media.">
<main class="legal-page"><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY & LEGAL / B TECKY</p><h1 class="display">Privacy Policy</h1><p>A clear explanation of the information, services and technologies involved when you visit B Tecky.</p><small>Last updated: 1 November 2026</small></div></section><article class="container legal-content">
<section><h2>Who runs this site</h2><p>This site is run by Lavish, creator of the B Tecky channel. Contact: <a href="mailto:lavishsheth122@gmail.com">lavishsheth122@gmail.com</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Arcade Score Checker</h2><p>The Score Checker processes the email you enter inside your browser. It converts it to a one-way fingerprint and compares it with a list of fingerprints supplied with the page. The email itself is not sent to the site's server by this matching flow. Results may show a partly hidden name, points, milestone status, rank and completed activity names from the available facilitator report.</p><p>The Points Calculator can request a Google Skills public profile URL that you submit. The URL is sent to B Tecky's profile-fetch endpoint so the public page can be read and parsed. Do not submit passwords, cookies, session tokens or other credentials. A profile URL may be retained in your browser's local storage for convenience until you clear site data.</p></section>
<section><h2>Advertising and cookies</h2><p>This site may display Google AdSense advertising. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies for ad delivery, measurement and personalization, subject to your choices and applicable settings. You can manage personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how Google uses information from sites and apps that use its services</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>YouTube videos and third-party services</h2><p>Pages may embed YouTube videos or load YouTube channel information. When you interact with an embedded player, YouTube may receive information and use cookies under its own policies. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p><p>Fonts may be loaded from Google Fonts. External links open third-party services governed by their own privacy terms.</p></section>
<section><h2>Blog and contact</h2><p>Blog pages are published as static content. If you contact B Tecky by email or a contact form, the information you choose to send is used to respond to your message.</p></section>
<section><h2>Not an official Google site</h2><p>B Tecky is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google. Points shown by our tools are estimates; Google Skills and official program communications remain the source of truth.</p></section>
<section><h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated as the site and its features change. The date above will be revised when the policy is updated.</p></section>
</article></main>
</BaseLayout>
